My apologies for posting in non-ASCII format.
further wizmode testing revealed the following.

#dipping a cursed loadstone in a fountain turns it into a cursed 
flintstone which weighs the same as a loadstone (500).
If you can get two 500-weight flintstones to stack and then throw them 
and pick them up, they revert to true flintstones (weight 10).
Similarly, dropping them one-by-one also fixes the flintstones, while 
dropping multiple 'fake' flintstones does not.

Very curious... (and it makes the threat of loadstones go away 
altogether (for this version anyway))

I will go and submit this as a bug


